flowchart LR
  subgraph entrypoints[entrypoints — 호출만]
    CLI[rra CLI]
    API[REST API FastAPI]
    MCP[MCP 서버]
    UI[Streamlit / 웹 SPA]
  end
  subgraph application[application — 유스케이스·서비스]
    PRE[precheck_overlap]
    GEN[generate_proposal]
    REV[review_draft]
    DIF[differentiate]
    RM[RunManager]
    PORTS[(ports: DocumentRepository · LLMPort · RunStorePort · RendererPort · TaskRunner)]
  end
  subgraph domain[domain — 순수 규칙·모델]
    MODELS[ProposalRequest · Draft · ReviewRound · DraftVersion]
    RULES[overlap · keywords · relevance · grounding · numbers · llm_output · review_flow · agent_policy]
  end
  subgraph adapters[adapters — 외부 라이브러리는 여기만]
    SQL[(SQLite FTS5 + sqlite-vec)]
    EMB[sentence-transformers e5]
    LLM[mlx-lm Qwen 7B · Gemini Argon]
    SRC[sources: OpenAlex · 알리오 · own · KIPRIS · NTIS · ScienceON]
    HWPX[HWPX 렌더러]
    RUNS[runs 파일 저장소 · run_log]
  end
  COMP[composition.py build_*]
  entrypoints --> application
  application --> domain
  application -. 포트 .-> PORTS
  adapters -- 구현 --> PORTS
  COMP --> entrypoints
  COMP --> adapters
